smissed defamation suit, though state GOP officials claim the district is winnable. Without public general-election polling, the forecast rests on fundamentals and ratings, which point to a comfortable Hayes win in the mid-teens.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9824, "margin": 14.66}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9772, "margin": 14.5}]}